Linked-list MCQs with reasons
Understand the idea
Choose the option that matches how links work.
Use the explanation to understand why that option is correct.


Recursive output: option B
All nodes print in reverse order. The recursive call runs before printf. For 10 → 20 → 30, calls reach NULL first, then return and print 30 20 10. Links do not change.


Reverse-list statement: option A, conditionally
